---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
    title="理財教練服務｜建立個人財務系統 | SmartUtilBox"
    description="一對一理財教練服務，協助你整理現金流、建立預算與長期投資的個人財務系統。"
    currentPath="/coaching"
    headerTitle="理財教練服務"
>
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">
         <!-- Section A: Hero Section --> <section class="py-20 lg:py-32 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-50"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center"> <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 leading-tight"> 理財教練：<br class="hidden sm:block"/>建立你的個人財務系統 </h1> <p class="text-xl text-slate-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"> 終結現金流焦慮，從記帳、預算到長期投資的觀念，一步步建立屬於自己的財務系統。 </p> <a href="#calendly-section" class="inline-block bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 hover:bg-emerald-700 transition duration-300 ease-in-out transform hover:-translate-y-1"> 預約免費 15 分鐘財務健檢 </a> </div> </section> <!-- Section B: Lead Capture --> <section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white text-slate-800 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200"> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">還沒準備好通話？先訂閱理財筆記</h2> <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed"> 留下 Email，新文章與新工具上線時我們會通知你。內容以現金流管理、房貸與長期投資的基本觀念為主。 </p> <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xvzvlvwa" method="POST" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto"> <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="您的姓名" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1" required> <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required> <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto"> 訂閱 </button> </form> </div> </section> <!-- Section C: The Framework --> <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"> <div class="text-center mb-16"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900">為什麼你需要這套教練計畫？</h2> <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-emerald-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded"></div> </div> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10"> <!-- Phase 1 Card --> <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border-none  hover:shadow-md transition duration-300"> <div class="text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xl mb-2">Phase 1</div> <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">現金流防漏與系統化</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 痛點 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">工時極長、收入高但存款不成比例、缺乏紀律。</p> </div> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 解方 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">盤點債務與隱藏支出，為你建構「發薪日自動分配系統」。讓你在不知不覺中蓄水，創造無痛的投資本金。</p> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Phase 2 Card --> <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border-none  hover:shadow-md transition duration-300"> <div class="text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xl mb-2">Phase 2</div> <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">長期投資觀念與資產配置</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 痛點 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">害怕通膨侵蝕購買力，對單一股市感到焦慮，不懂多元配置。</p> </div> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 解方 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">認識分散投資、資產配置、風險承受度與通膨的基本觀念，學會用試算工具檢驗自己的計畫。本服務不推薦或銷售任何特定金融商品。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Section D: Final CTA & Calendly --> <section id="calendly-section" class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100"> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">想聊聊你的情況？</h2> <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10 leading-relaxed"> 透過聯絡表單簡單描述你的狀況與想討論的主題，我們會回信安排時間。 </p> <a href="/contact?service=coaching" class="inline-block bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-slate-700 transition duration-300"> 填寫聯絡表單 </a> </div> </section> <!-- Quick Needs Submission Block --> <section class="bg-white text-slate-800 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-10 border-b border-blue-800 flex-shrink-0"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" data-i18n="footer-cta-title">對理財有疑問？留下一句話，讓我們開始對話。</h2> <form action="/contact" method="GET" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto"> <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required> <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-md" data-i18n="footer-cta-btn"> 開始諮詢 </button> </form> </div> </section>

    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
/* i18n Translations */ const i18n = { 'zh-tw': { 'title': '理財教練服務', 'subtitle': '專為高薪專業人士打造的理財教練服務', 'footer-disclaimer': '試算結果僅供參考，實際貸款條件以各銀行提供為準。', 'footer-privacy': '隱私權政策', 'footer-terms': '服務條款', 'footer-guide': '理財專欄', 'footer-cta-title': '對理財有疑問？留下一句話，讓我們開始對話。', 'footer-cta-btn': '開始諮詢' }, 'en': { 'title': '1-on-1 Coaching', 'subtitle': 'Financial coaching for high-income professionals', 'footer-disclaimer': 'Results are for reference only. Actual terms depend on the bank.', 'footer-privacy': 'Privacy Policy', 'footer-terms': 'Terms of Service', 'footer-guide': 'Financial Blog', 'footer-cta-title': 'Have financial questions? Leave a message and let\'s start a conversation.', 'footer-cta-btn': 'Start Consulting' } }; /* Utilities */ function getLang() { return document.getElementById('language-selector').value; } function t(key) { return i18n[getLang()][key] || key; } function updateTranslations() { document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n]').forEach(el => { const key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n'); if (i18n[getLang()][key]) { if (el.tagName === 'INPUT' && el.type === 'button') { el.value = i18n[getLang()][key]; } else { el.textContent = i18n[getLang()][key]; } } }); } document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => { /* Setup language selector */ const langSelector = document.getElementById('language-selector'); if (langSelector) { const savedLang = localStorage.getItem('calc-lang'); if (savedLang && (savedLang === 'zh-tw' || savedLang === 'en')) { langSelector.value = savedLang; } langSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => { localStorage.setItem('calc-lang', e.target.value); updateTranslations(); }); } /* Initial render */ updateTranslations(); });
</script>
